/li>\n<li>\n<p>对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 及序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\">\\([A]^\\xi\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):|B|=\\xi\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}rowbottom\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2RowbottomCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall c\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\lambda)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;|\\{c(a)\\mid a\\in[H]^n\\}|&lt;\\omega\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard2\\text{-}rowbottom\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLargecard2RowbottomCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall c\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^{&lt;\\omega},\\lambda)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(|H|=\\kappa\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;|\\{c(a)\\mid a\\in[H]^n\\}|&lt;\\omega\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every coloring of the finite subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> into fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> colors has a size-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> set on which only finitely many colors occur at each arity.</li>\n<li>The partition arrow has been expanded into its function-graph quantifiers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{